  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Deep within the heart of an ancient forest lived a small band of woodland
    critters. Though they were vastly different and not all from the forest, they
    had formed inseparable bonds with each other. Together they spent their days
    exploring hidden groves, gathering food, and enjoying the peaceful life their
    forest provided.


    Their tranquility is shattered when a mysterious insect
    empire launches a surprise invasion. Swarms of ants, grasshoppers, flies, and
    armored beetles descend upon the forest, capturing the critters one by one and
    carrying them away into the unknown. The once-vibrant woodland becomes overrun
    with insect patrols and dangerous obstacles. As one of the only animals to escape
    capture, the player must journey across the forest to rescue their friends and
    reclaim their home, leveraging unique abilities and movement tactics that help
    overcome challenging platforming sections. With each completed level, the friend
    group becoems more whole. Through teamwork, courage, and friendship, the woodland
    critters must unite to uproot the insect invasion and restore peace to the forest.'
